graph TD
    A[Start]:::startEnd --> B[Input Current Value (C)]:::input
    B --> C[Input Previous Value (P)]:::input
    C --> D[Calculate Difference D = C - P]:::process
    D --> E[Calculate Ratio R = D / P]:::process
    E --> F[Calculate Percentage Increase = R * 100]:::process
    F --> G[Round Result (optional)]:::process
    G --> H[Output Percentage Increase]:::output
    H --> I[End]:::startEnd
    
    classDef startEnd fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef input fill:#bbf,stroke:#333;
    classDef process fill:#ddf,stroke:#333;
    classDef output fill:#bfb,stroke:#333;